{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2021-01-28 08:00:00', 'title': "THAD TRENT APPOINTED ON SEMICONDUCTOR'S EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER", 'text': 'PHOENIX--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ON SEMICONDUCTOR (NASDAQ: ON) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THAD TRENT WILL JOIN ON SEMICONDUCTOR AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER (CFO) EFFECTIVE FEB. 16, 2021. TRENT JOINS ON SEMICONDUCTOR AS A NEARLY 30 YEAR FINANCE VETERAN OF THE TECH INDUSTRY. TRENT HAS HELD SEVERAL LEADERSHIP ROLES THROUGHOUT HIS CAREER, MOST RECENTLY AS CFO AT CYPRESS SEMICONDUCTOR RESPONSIBLE FOR STRATEGIC PLANNING, ACCOUNTING, INVESTOR RELATIONS, TAX, CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT AND IN'}